<title>USA: Ohio Art Co sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Ohio Art Co sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BRYAN, Ohio 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ohio Art Co said Monday its board declared an extra dividend of $0.04 a share, payable May 6 to shareholders of record April 7.</p>
<p>The company also declared its regular dividend of $0.04 a share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
